{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105293","id":2454918055,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6SUxOn","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105293","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105293.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105293.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105293","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105293/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105293/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105293/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3f364392712c8dc88ade1afbc5a396ef48de9c30","number":105293,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Include recursive behavior in Control focus_mode and mouse_filter checks","user":{"login":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady","html_url":"https://github.com/Grublady","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Various `Control` and `Viewport` methods check to make sure that the a Control's `focus_mode` or `mouse_filter` allows it to accept focus or mouse events, respectively.\r\n\r\nHowever, they fail to include `focus_recursive_behavior` and `mouse_recursive_behavior` in these checks, so they may incorrectly succeed even if the Control inherits a `RECURSIVE_BEHAVIOR_DISABLED` value.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes the checks use `get_focus_mode_with_recursive` and `get_mouse_filter_with_recursive` in order to catch these cases.\r\n\r\n~### PS\r\nIt seems there is no web documentation for `Control`'s \"recursive behavior\" properties & methods—\r\nWhere should I open an issue about this?~","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-04-11T23:05:07Z","updated_at":"2025-04-12T16:10:55Z","closed_at":"2025-04-12T15:53:36Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b3093d489a4e62887303a52a1b60a521254fe687","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Grublady:grab-focus-recursive","ref":"grab-focus-recursive","repo":{"id":825140021,"node_id":"R_kgDOMS6jNQ","name":"godot","full_name":"Grublady/godot","owner":{"login":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady",